claim:ac_dc--little_richard--attributed a riff:InfluenceClaim ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Little_Richard> ;
    riff:describes influence:ac_dc--little_richard ;
    riff:evidenceQuote "It was fantastic, indescribable.\" Jon Lord of Deep Purple said \"There would have been no Deep Purple if there had been no Little Richard.\" AC/DC's early lead vocalist and co-songwriter Bon Scott idolized Richard and aspired to sing like him, its lead guitarist and co-songwriter Angus Young was first inspired to play guitar after listening to Richard, and rhythm guitarist and co-writer Malcolm Young derived his signature sound from playing his guitar like Richard's piano."@en ;
    riff:hasEvidenceKind riff:Attributed .

claim:aerosmith--jimi_hendrix--attributed a riff:InfluenceClaim ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jimi_Hendrix> ;
    riff:describes influence:aerosmith--jimi_hendrix ;
    riff:evidenceQuote "Hendrix also influenced Black Sabbath, industrial artist Marilyn Manson, blues musician Stevie Ray Vaughan, Randy Hansen, Uli Jon Roth, Kiss's Ace Frehley, Metallica Kirk Hammett, Aerosmith's Brad Whitford, Judas Priest's Richie Faulkner, instrumental rock guitarist Joe Satriani, King's X singer/bassist Doug Pinnick, Adrian Belew, and heavy metal guitarist Yngwie Malmsteen, who said: \"[Hendrix] created modern electric playing, without question ..."@en ;
    riff:hasEvidenceKind riff:Attributed .

claim:aerosmith--led_zeppelin--attributed a riff:InfluenceClaim ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Led_Zeppelin> ;
    riff:describes influence:aerosmith--led_zeppelin ;
    riff:evidenceQuote "Led Zeppelin have influenced hard rock and heavy metal bands such as Deep Purple, Black Sabbath, Rush, Queen, Scorpions, Aerosmith, the Black Crowes, and Megadeth as well as progressive metal bands like Tool and Dream Theater."@en ;
    riff:hasEvidenceKind riff:Attributed .

claim:aerosmith--led_zeppelin--attributed--2 a riff:InfluenceClaim ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aerosmith> ;
    riff:describes influence:aerosmith--led_zeppelin ;
    riff:evidenceQuote "Influenced by bands such as the Beatles, the Rolling Stones, the Yardbirds, Led Zeppelin, and the New York Dolls, Aerosmith proved to be a major influence themselves on subsequently massively successful bands and musicians; according to Perry, Eddie Van Halen once told him that his band Van Halen \"started out on the suburban L.A. club circuit, playing Aerosmith songs\"."@en ;
    riff:hasEvidenceKind riff:Attributed .

