    riff:describes influence:aretha_franklin--otis_redding ;
    riff:evidenceQuote "Other artists influenced by Redding include Led Zeppelin, the Grateful Dead, Lynyrd Skynyrd, the Doors, and virtually every soul and R&B musician from the early years, such as Al Green, Etta James, William Bell, Aretha Franklin, Marvin Gaye and Conley."@en ;
    riff:hasEvidenceKind riff:Attributed .

