    riff:describes influence:iron_maiden--jimi_hendrix ;
    riff:evidenceQuote "I'd heard Jimi Hendrix using legato when I was growing up, and I liked that style of playing.\" Stating that he \"was inspired by blues rock rather than metal,\" Adrian Smith was influenced by Johnny Winter and Pat Travers, leading to him becoming a \"melodic player.\" Janick Gers prefers a more improvised style, largely inspired by Ritchie Blackmore, which he says is in contrast to Smith's \"rhythmic\" sound."@en ;
    riff:hasEvidenceKind riff:Declared .

