    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mahalia_Jackson> ;
    riff:describes influence:little_richard--mahalia_jackson ;
    riff:evidenceQuote "Heilbut writes: \"With the exception of Chuck Berry and Fats Domino, there is scarcely a pioneer rock and roll singer who didn't owe his stuff to the great gospel lead singers.\" Specifically, Little Richard, Mavis Staples of the Staple Singers, Donna Summer, Sam Cooke, Ray Charles, Della Reese, and Aretha Franklin have all named Jackson as an inspiration."@en ;
