    riff:evidenceQuote "The title track of Rancid's album Indestructible says: \"I'll keep listening to that great Joe Strummer!\" Outside rock music, Chuck D has credited the Clash as an inspiration for Public Enemy, in particular for their use of socially and politically conscious lyrics, which gained them attention from the music press: \"They talked about important subjects, so therefore journalists printed what they said, which was very pointed ..."@en ;
    riff:hasEvidenceKind riff:Declared .

