    riff:evidenceQuote "\"Eight Miles High\" is marked by McGuinn's groundbreaking lead guitar playing, which saw the guitarist attempting to emulate the free form jazz saxophone playing of John Coltrane, and in particular, Coltrane's playing on the song \"India\" from his Impressions album."@en ;
